  partName: Valve Cover (3)
  description: The Valve Cover (3) is a small, compact metal component situated at
    the middle-center-center of the jet engine, covering and protecting the engine's
    valve train. Its metal-mid material offers a balance of strength, durability,
    and thermal resistance, making it suitable for this application. Notably, the
    valve cover's design allows for easy access to the valve train for maintenance
    and repair.
